conformance-relock (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:58.4772236Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
conformance-relock (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:58.4772733Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
