conformance-relock (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:58.4784828Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
conformance-relock (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:58.4785575Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
conformance-relock (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:53:58.4795169Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
